# Glucose Watchdog Demo 2

A dependency-free browser demo of the Glucose Watchdog main screen. It displays seven days of glucose and insulin data, one 24-hour page at a time, with requirement-defined low, acceptable, borderline-high, and high range highlighting, reading details, confirmed deletion, glucose warnings, and bulk spreadsheet import.

## Run locally

```sh
npm start
```

Then open <http://localhost:4173>.

## Import glucose data

Use **Import spreadsheet** to load `.xlsx`, `.csv`, or `.tsv` data. The first row must contain either `timestamp` and `glucose`, or `date`, `time`, and `glucose` columns. Only the most recent seven dates are displayed.

## Test

```sh
npm test
```
